# FIN PHY — All-orders resonance/carrier reconstruction certificate

Date: 2026-09-23

## Finite cyclic theorem

For a cyclic carrier of size `q>=11` and five distinct positive-amplitude
character modes `k=1,...,5`, define

`Z_q(phi)=q^-1 sum_j exp[ sum_k b_k cos(2*pi*k*j/q + phi_k) ]`, `b_k>0`.

The Bessel expansion is supported on integer tuples `n` satisfying

`sum_k k n_k = 0 mod q`

and every coefficient is strictly positive.  Hence termwise `cos <= 1` gives

`Z_q(phi) <= Z_q(0)`.

Equality requires every admissible relation phase to vanish.  The relations

`k phi_1 - phi_k = 0`, `k=2,...,5`,

plus `q phi_1=0` imply exactly

`phi_k = k*2*pi*a/q`, `a in Z_q`.

Thus phase locking is exact and all-orders at arbitrary positive radial
amplitudes; it is not only a cubic/Taylor phenomenon.

## Continuum theorem

For the circle integral, the congruence becomes exact equality
`sum k n_k=0`; the finite condition `q phi_1=0` disappears.  The equality
manifold is exactly

`phi_k = k alpha`, `alpha in S1`.

Hence the global all-orders hierarchy is

`T5 -> S1` in the continuum and `T5 -> Z_q` at finite `q`.

For even `q`, an added fixed positive alternating coordinate `z(-1)^j`
reduces the phase maxima to even translations; negative `z` gives odd
translations.  Allowing the parity sign jointly restores the full `q` orbit.

## General finite Abelian theorem

Let `G` be a finite Abelian carrier and let the positive-amplitude characters
used in the partition sum generate its dual.  Relation-respecting phase
assignments are characters of the generated dual group and, by finite
Pontryagin duality, are evaluations at points of `G`.

Therefore the locked global-maximizer set is canonically a copy of the supplied
carrier `G` (modulo a stabilizer if the selected characters do not generate the
full dual).

For `G=(Z_q)^d`, the all-orders equality set is `(Z_q)^d`; in the torus limit
it is `T^d`.

### Consequence

The nonlinearity **reconstructs the carrier translation group**.  It does not
select which carrier nature uses.  This moves the dimension-source problem
upstream from nonlinear phase locking to carrier/refinement sourcehood.
